OL,3,ANorway and Finland leaders hold rare
OL,4,Acall with Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinland's President Alexander Stubb and
OL,7,FNorwegian Prime Minister Jonas Gahr
OL,8,FStC8re have held a joint call with
OL,9,FVladimir Putin - a rare contact between
OL,10,Fthe Russian president and European
OL,11,Fleaders.
OL,13,FThe aim was looking at "future
OL,14,Fnegotiations to help to end the war" in
OL,15,FUkraine, their offices said. They said
OL,16,Ftheir initiative was not on behalf of
OL,17,F"Europe as a whole".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
